          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On November 20, 1981, around 6:00 PM, several witnesses observed in the sky a glowing ball followed by a multicolored trail. This ball moved at a very high speed, crossing the sky in a south-north direction. The observation lasted 15 to 30 seconds in a clear sky. One of the witnesses heard a whistle. These individuals may have witnessed an atmospheric reentry.",
